{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "ddb388dfb2992994bb7fc0b046ce9efa347962f26a33797fd4381a52026a1b9c", "ja": "頑張れ！　レザーマスク", "zh": "加油！皮革假面", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bea3f72bc80104307950235a9f78f46db26fdc1a109223f536c9304d40813389", "ja": "リハーサルを終え、怖がる演技が難しいと悩\nむエレナ。そこで茜はプロデューサーに、レ\nザーマスクを被ってエレナを襲おうと提案す\nる。プロデューサーはエレナの反撃を受け、\n作戦は失敗だが、絆は深まり結果オーライ。", "zh": "排练结束后，艾蕾娜为害怕的演技很难而烦恼。  \n于是茜向制作人提议，戴上皮革面具袭击艾蕾娜。  \n制作人遭到艾蕾娜反击，作战虽然失败，  \n但羁绊加深了，结果也算圆满。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7a4d1bbf9ae5305f3e9d927e4be252c296921653e58273d420bdd3f7be8f3b4f", "ja": "（映画『誰ソ彼ノ淵』の撮影は順調だ。次は、\n茜たちが山で逃げるシーンのリハーサルだ……）", "zh": "（电影《谁黄昏之渊》的拍摄进展顺利。接下来要进行的是茜她们在山中逃跑场景的排练……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "3415fd1f0901ba2edd8c8aec800438ebca2ce9b8bd845fd28339c526019c7c01", "ja": "ハア……ハア……。このまま行けば山頂ね。\n茜さん、エレナさん！　こっちよ！", "zh": "呼……呼……。照这样下去就到山顶了。\n茜、艾莲娜！这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "ccab84469f3b3c7a16fa68fd002b1026e54c3f250fcbcecdf0dd001bf2121345", "ja": "ハア……ハア……！\nせ、先生！　私、足が……もう……。", "zh": "哈……哈……！\n老、老师！我的腿……已经……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "ca949fd2e8c27b789fd40691580bdee079fb217b8bcd55b8ed1b89ed1dbbd4e8", "ja": "ハア……ハア……がんばって、茜！", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……加油，茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "d60825763b788d9bf126f7344b27761c40af9ddf7fd113e248a17e37a1c7ba92", "ja": "ごめんなさい……私が、もっと早く気づいていたら。\nふたりとも、村に着くまでの我慢よ！", "zh": "对不起……要是我能早点察觉到的话。\n你们两个都要忍住，坚持到村子为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "92dc6cbeeb126030623c0bc48bd5bb96f2ca68da6b0c532a8fbc185c6c5685a6", "ja": "だからそれまで、決して足を止めてはいけないの。\nいいわね？　そうしなくちゃ……ッ！！", "zh": "所以在那之前，绝对不能停下脚步。\n听明白了吗？必须这样才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "cb5a699db8911a21c927e02483eab1daf5b790c6636a760919802e42541b9146", "ja": "ハア……ハア……。\n先生？　どうかしたの？", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……\n老师？您怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "cc3ea9cbd9e356f1d1d03cce50f7ece364b6f7f99bbd58922b3d201edbcd6c2a", "ja": "な、何でもないわ。ふたりは、先に行ってちょうだい。\n……振り返っちゃダメよ！　お願いだからっ！", "zh": "没、没什么。你们两个先走吧。\n……不许回头看！拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "cb80b025d5347c4c870e4695755dd9372ba26a93dcd8356ea215ab871fa0aa8b", "ja": "ん？　あの木の向こうに、何か見えて……えっ？\nあれ、もしかして……。", "zh": "嗯？那棵树后面，好像能看到什么……咦？\n那个，难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "8ea69157eeb10df46e7c930cbef1c7814fb402c366875e6ad06cb71f7276c9c3", "ja": "キャァァァァーーーッ！！！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1010_kantoku", "source_sha256": "531c7c89510f925ae9ee8549b83c626daa87b6513f9702b0d842a4a893861352", "ja": "はい、カーット！！　すみません、島原さん！\n悲鳴のとこ、もっと緊張感もらえませんか？", "zh": "好，咔！！不好意思，岛原小姐！悲鸣的地方，能不能再多一点紧张感？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "9ed27cf41f0b649547c65eeca350229d121d218e5e42d8b9457b40429263b444", "ja": "えっ？　……わ、わかったヨ！\nもう1回、お願いしマース！", "zh": "诶？……我、我知道了哟！\n再来1次，拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "dcf21fc4a970ab1f31af53c6e7c36a319abbf2341b03190a35a83d135e449c7c", "ja": "ん？　あの木の向こうに、何か見えて……えっ？\nあれ、もしかして……。キャァァァッ！！！", "zh": "嗯？那棵树的后面，好像能看到什么……咦？\n那个，难道是……。呀啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1013_kantoku", "source_sha256": "24253bff0f85713c18894caa1dda0c8875961eef26d043358d2dd3f78a1b6b1f", "ja": "カーット！！", "zh": "咔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "c334aa490a291cfcb6556ff0ec483cf3a231e5bf0430445467d185d81d32ea6c", "ja": "あれ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "608dfca71cc97f1eb2ef224fdbe66553d16b4614f3dd1718373fd36fd5be5b7e", "ja": "（休憩と打ち合わせを挟み、エレナは同じシーンに\n挑戦したが、監督は一度も首を縦に振る事はなかった）", "zh": "（中间休息并商量了一番后，艾蕾娜再次挑战了同一个场景，可导演一次都没有点头。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "e0bf36450bc6670d5f8e421d9fb8e958b3a434ccf4fd9958181b0664cdc9b7b8", "ja": "うぅ……アカネ、カオリ、ごめんネ……。\nワタシのせいで、何度もやり直しになっちゃって……。", "zh": "呜……茜、歌织，对不起哦……\n都是因为我，才重拍了这么多次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "f4b33c34c1a2a69dfb6221bdd45168eca5a24e95930a177711a68d5d64efe904", "ja": "気にしないで、エレナちゃん。私も、\nたくさんNGを出してしまったことがあるもの。", "zh": "别在意，艾蕾娜。我也有过很多次拍出NG镜头的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "2b207c8e16244bdba0313d3681d524fa9efc23f13e4ea971899afe297d4ab17d", "ja": "ありがと、カオリ。演技ってムズカシイネ……。\n怖がるお芝居って、どうしたらできるのカナ？", "zh": "谢谢你，歌织。演戏好难啊……\n要怎样才能演出害怕的感觉呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "c9ea249af4d305095084fe56818dcffc16cca6a32270a6106e4de1953df8a61b", "ja": "そうね……エレナちゃんが、とても怖い経験をしたら、\n役の気持ちに近づけるかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "是啊……如果艾丽娜经历了非常可怕的事情，或许能更接近角色的心情，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "79c8583ee92f077c7c805a12eb2cef014a9ffee0d4ce3b7bef219fcac0eb281a", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、\n{$P$}ちゃん。", "zh": "{$P$}妹妹、\n{$P$}妹妹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "641f0763652c51318f811336ab1965b4b8415a1e96ee8c0039bcc3ce8adb3663", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ、茜。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了吗，茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "002fa78d934ace68504d275bb55c0bade8892498b3033817b823886d4a1ef659", "ja": "茜ちゃん、いいアイディアを思いついたよ。\nちょっと耳貸して？　あのね……。", "zh": "小茜，我想到一个好主意哦。\n把耳朵借我一下？是这样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "09c067f324fe6e15e06b3b3ab417be79a5ab2c9a9bdd2277f4120eebec5faac6", "ja": "（茜発案の『エレナの悲鳴が上手くなる大作戦』……。\n出番まで待機という指示だが……不安しかないぞ！）", "zh": "（茜提出的《让艾蕾娜更擅长发出悲鸣大作战》……。虽然吩咐我等到出场前待命……可我只有不安啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "fb97998500df507e907ceb0a3fef186d0666826954d07c1edb88c4e943c81bc6", "ja": "監督さんが呼んでるって聞いたんだけど……\nこんな時間に、なんだろうネ？　アカネ。", "zh": "我听说导演在叫我……这么晚了，会是什么事呢？茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "f084f91fbfaa082b1d39cf15a4153d847e4eac8c12050378ba7dbc0cbda8533a", "ja": "さ、さあ？　何の用事かなー？\n茜ちゃんも全然、いっこも、心当たりないなー！", "zh": "这、这谁知道呢？找我有什么事呀——？\n小茜完全、根本、一点头绪都没有呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "1f603a411d45cf0483407eca5b0b1b407489641f2ab4ddaf9a41073542d63503", "ja": "もしかして、昼間のリハーサルでちゃんとお芝居\nできなかったから、怒られちゃうのかな？　うぅ……。", "zh": "难道是因为白天彩排的时候戏演得\n不够好，所以要挨骂了吗？呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "92d2b47f1576e0349dc72a21a088ec0e87dfcda7f00f91fd3eca270a301e7654", "ja": "ねえ、アカネ。どうしたら……あれ？", "zh": "呐，茜。该怎么办才好……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "d0f2233850a52ca42def82d5e9c46d6060dccc79d6677f7e3654f3661e05c5e2", "ja": "アカネ……？　どこいったノ……？", "zh": "茜……？跑到哪里去了呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "814f80c3c19015a87ede2d6d1c49e3e65bf187d7013f919ce78d1d4b88dbb826", "ja": "よしよし、計画は順調に進行中！　さあ、\n次は{$P$}ちゃんの出番だ！", "zh": "很好很好，计划正在顺利进行中！好啦，\n接下来轮到小{$P$}登场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "191a750904c6ae4336d1ee7072a7615c5db232856616663d9c40b06d47e3a5f4", "ja": "行け、{$P$}ちゃん！\nそのレザーマスクをかぶって！　力の限り！！", "zh": "冲啊，{$P$}！\n把那个皮革面具戴上！　使出全力！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "05f021d94af6f2ca713451e449d0b7140c42a157183a1f3d8159b42626c7f4ba", "ja": "（茜、他人事だと思って……まぁいいか。\n今はとにかく、エレナのためだ……！）", "zh": "（茜还真把这当成别人的事……算了。总之，现在都是为了艾莲娜……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "66640a8db7dfa706c7f7bd3b27b751d5dfe2c32b5ac38a8c1ae2efd259cc3113", "ja": "んごごごご……んごんご……！\n……んごんご！", "zh": "嗯唔唔唔唔……嗯唔嗯唔……！\n……嗯唔嗯唔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "853a1e1c4bb261721cbe25c1f7cfdff46e0ef01b3e14d2a61d410c763daae456", "ja": "キャアッ！？\nえ、何……？　アナタ、誰！？", "zh": "呀——！？\n咦，什么……？你是谁！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "a1e701571daaa5c572f915f123fa64e47cf6beb9f59d79f7cc28ca3c6f095091", "ja": "あっ！　もしかして、アナタがアカネを……！？", "zh": "啊！难道就是你把茜……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1035_p", "source_sha256": "22d7088acc792d0d5a74c0ac4faf546dc01dcc7aba38326a16cdb7e78a88fb49", "ja": "……んごんご！", "zh": "……唔唔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1036_023aka", "source_sha256": "573d313fea72a85581170da98a00533d515b1afd4c0833869a5bb34e46cffdc1", "ja": "（その調子だよ、{$P$}ちゃん！\nエレナちゃんを怖がらせて、悲鳴をあげさせるのだ！）", "zh": "（就是这样，{$P$}！把艾莲娜吓到，让她发出尖叫吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "128b3148acd626d95c822115a83eb729febc7ba7a118c0cceb62a71f0238c043", "ja": "（茜ちゃんは！　エレナちゃんの成長のため、\n心を鬼にしてエレナちゃんを千尋の谷に突き落とす！）", "zh": "（小茜啊！为了艾丽娜的成长，我要狠下心来把艾丽娜推下千寻之谷！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1038_018ele", "source_sha256": "a91e36f46fdc95af32b217f5889d914e350ce4c4acb3e50139cf131e2078db04", "ja": "ひどい……。アカネはどこ？\nアカネを返して！！", "zh": "太过分了……茜呢？\n把茜还给我！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1039_018ele", "source_sha256": "1a03fe7aad3f8b2e3fb670cd7d3d1779ec69899454eec697057e6c3345672657", "ja": "アナタなんか……こ、怖くないんだから！\n……たああああああっ！　そりゃっ！", "zh": "我才不怕你……才、才不怕！\n……喝啊啊啊啊啊！看招！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1040_se", "source_sha256": "cbe44b5e4a881502d3b92ab56432d6874adba4e7f41481adc34eaa518718c70a", "ja": "ドカッ", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "7932816f61b2f475584dc0d53e9fd1ef1a2c85084e84f8367ed70baa46883fcb", "ja": "ん、んご～～～～！？\nんごんーご！　んご～！", "zh": "唔、唔哦～～～～！？\n唔哦唔——哦！　唔哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1042_023aka", "source_sha256": "eb8ef41029592134027cb67bb48d7cee39b014febf2e9a299199fe296bbb88f5", "ja": "ニャ！？　ストップ、エレナちゃんストップ！\nその人、{$P$}ちゃんだから！", "zh": "喵！？停下，艾蕾娜，快停下！\n那个人是{$P$}呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1043_018ele", "source_sha256": "01f0ac158f87fd358efd045fca19f10c3f8841993349c4c6bc9134e1e17c7aac", "ja": "え、アカネ？　……えっ？\n{$P$}！？", "zh": "咦，茜？……诶？\n{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1045_018ele", "source_sha256": "d9b2df54f3cecac824391b48359de2df4eac68e1a02eca88ff9a030dfb5fff8a", "ja": "もう！　アカネも{$P$}もひどいヨ！\nワタシにドッキリを仕掛けるなんて……。", "zh": "真是的！茜和{$P$}都太过分了！居然对我搞恶作剧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1046_018ele", "source_sha256": "ebe0cb4419357fcbbeb47e8ad9d4573717cca83ea2eefa01f3fc635c61691651", "ja": "でも……アカネ、{$P$}！\n怖がってあげなくて、ゴメンネ♪", "zh": "不过……茜，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "af27678a3442670a8cd87f8f7eae8f2baa3d09825372979b70a1de5eee8be030", "ja": "うん。まさか、\n返り討ちに遭うとは思わなかったよ……。", "zh": "嗯。真没想到，\n居然会被你反将了一军……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1048_018ele", "source_sha256": "0a20682c72cd58a44491cc7902bd349efa95e0b6c88a424cf896258ba14b4072", "ja": "だって、{$P$}\nちっとも怖くなかったヨ？　それより……。", "zh": "因为，{$P$}一点都不可怕呀？倒是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1049_018ele", "source_sha256": "d7d66d853337f606ba93aec2a07d6f31eb47500892ef863b28967338d3ad3d80", "ja": "アカネがいなくなっちゃった……って気づいた時が、\nワタシ、今までで一番怖かったかも……。", "zh": "意识到茜不见了……的时候，可能是我至今为止最害怕的时刻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1050_023aka", "source_sha256": "a96e62e7c5ff38a09d861b3700fb4c057b2c24079f9b67f7cad0467bab8303c5", "ja": "エレナちゃん……。", "zh": "艾莲娜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1051_018ele", "source_sha256": "f2dc072e3588b1789605c5e5a1114de7d5edec56621404ebf838e0daff93de7d", "ja": "アカネを助けられるのはワタシしかいないでしょ？\nだから、がんばらなきゃって。", "zh": "能帮助茜的只有我，对吧？\n所以，我必须努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1052_023aka", "source_sha256": "029076d16f593cbc3e89c713d60de98bd11f382c9010d4c5b5a96fc5fa2c4c97", "ja": "エレナちゃんに、そんなに心配してもらえるなんて……\nううっ……茜ちゃん、すごい感動だよ！", "zh": "能得到艾琳娜这么担心……呜呜……小茜，我真的好感动啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1053_018ele", "source_sha256": "f21a1eb8bf0e9e832ff877716f13efaf7eb7d6aa1ddd7f59c4aa8e63f33d4484", "ja": "当たり前ダヨ！\nアカネは、ワタシの大切な友達だからネ♪", "zh": "那是当然的啦！\n因为茜可是我重要的朋友呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1054_018ele", "source_sha256": "b99678ad4ce144b1f767a49bee2a66fbafbfdf6b5a39c87c78269cfdf89c4f3c", "ja": "お芝居の役に立ったかどうかはわからないけど……\nふたりの気持ちは、ちゃんと伝わったヨ。", "zh": "虽然不知道有没有帮上这次演出的忙……  \n但你们两个人的心意，我确实感受到了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1055_018ele", "source_sha256": "7404f822267b9cf99b879e5011353fd76ab5794ff3c100a1abb7b751d0cb5da8", "ja": "だから、ありがとー！\nワタシ、明日の撮影がんばるからネ！　エヘヘ♪", "zh": "所以，谢谢你们——！\n我会努力完成明天的拍摄，加油哦！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_03_1056_p", "source_sha256": "ba093fd5b2b112f45b482f96824a667d5c78ecc8ac6738c76ebce7272d19bac4", "ja": "（茜の作戦は失敗に終わったけど……\nまあ、結果オーライかな？）", "zh": "（茜的作战虽然以失败告终……不过，结果还算不错吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
